; Print a new line
;
; Sends a carriage return (CHAR_CR) through #R$858B, which prints it in the
; story window or the input window as RawOutputFlag says. Keeps AF.
; .
; Hardware: none directly (see #R$858B).
@label=PrintNewLine
c$8583 PUSH AF
@isub=LD A,CHAR_CR
 $8584 LD A,$0D
 $8586 CALL $858B
 $8589 POP AF
 $858A RET
